    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 044df05c3f523560531ef6b54dcaff4492ffb56d -->\r\n## Independent review: no remaining actionable findings\r\n\r\nReviewer: separate Hermes Coder verification/review agent (`gpt-6-luna`), not the implementing agent; this comment relays that review rather than claiming a separate GitHub-account approval.\r\n\r\nReviewed the full contribution and corrective delta against main `0757563d82c9a675b9a99bd1508cb6227afccd0e`. The published commit's tree `74e3d732a2cc5677a22fac7c5d507dbef6245b02` exactly matches the reviewed and natively tested input.\r\n\r\n- Directory discovery, suite-only quick fallback, qualified named selection, module aliases, conditional precision and heavy-lane behavior covered.\r\n- Corrected documentation-token ignore detection and mixed preimage/postimage hunk coverage, with regressions and an in-test-only narrowing control.\r\n- `cargo test -p xtask -- --nocapture`: 73 passed; the five real Cargo directory selections executed 1/1/1/2/1 tests across three independently isolated fixture outputs.\r\n- All-target xtask Clippy and focused rustfmt checks passed. Legacy adapter edits were reviewed without reformatting unrelated code.\r\n- No new dependencies, application behavior changes or test migration. Application/release suites and other platforms were not run. Hosted checks are absent, not green.\r\n\r\nReview-cost: effort:medium; no effort escalation. Ready for the maintainer's manual merge; no merge or auto-merge was performed.\r\n",
