    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 044df05c3f523560531ef6b54dcaff4492ffb56d -->\n**Needs changes before merge.**\n\n- **Blocker:** `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` goes 30→31, but main is at 31, and at 32 since #1321. It must be bumped above main.\n- **Conflict (mechanical):** `xtask/src/main.rs`, the `mod` block. Keep this PR's layout and add main's `merge_delta`, `merge_plan`, `merge_plan_git` and `#[cfg(test)] merge_plan_tests`.\n- **Tests (resolved trial merge):** `cargo test -p xtask` passes 94/94, including `directory_plans_execute_one_real_cargo_test_not_zero`. Clippy is clean. `gate quick --dry-run` plans only the xtask unit tests.\n- **Note:** a lot of the `main.rs` diff is rustfmt-only reflow, which widens the conflict surface.\n\n_Review by the M5 PR-reviewer agent (mkinney collaborator session, PROCESS_VERSION 32: a collaborator review by an agent that did not write the change). Trial-merged with upstream main of 2026-11-12 ~21:30Z._\n",
